@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
title git-sync-turn e2e — the turn-end hook runs clean in every hooked def
' purpose: why the hook e2e drives a live TUI and reads a trace, not the host refs
' covers: e2e/git_sync_turn_test.go
' covers: e2e/testdata/git-sync-turn/**
' covers: packages/lib/hooks/git-sync-turn.sh
' covers: internal/contract/git_sync_turn_test.go
'   the hook's own contract ....... _spec/packages/lib/git-sync-turn.puml
'   where a clone's work lands .... _spec/internal/sbx/clone-workspace.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.

participant "e2e" as T <<app>>
participant "proveo run <def>\n(pty, TUI)" as R <<app>>
participant "sbx exec\n(live sandbox)" as X <<app>>
participant "git-sync-turn.sh" as H <<app>>
participant "<git-dir>/\nproveo-git-sync.ndjson" as TR <<app>>

T ARROW_MAIN R : fixture base, --input
R ARROW_MAIN T : TUI ready
T ARROW_MAIN X : drop HOOK_PROBE.txt
T ARROW_MAIN R : "Reply OK" + CR
R ARROW_MAIN H : Stop / stop / session.idle
H ARROW_MAIN TR : {dialect, result, error}
T ARROW_MAIN X : read trace + git state
X ARROW_MAIN T : assert allow, committed, pushed

note right of T
  **The file is the test's, not the model's.**
  The probe lands through sbx exec before the
  prompt, so only "a turn ended" rests on the
  model. A missing commit is then the hook's.
end note

note right of X
  **Read while the TUI still holds the prompt.**
  The sandbox is running, so exec needs no VM
  restart. After exit, refs/proveo shows the
  commit but never whether push or Stop failed.
end note

note right of TR
  **Only the trace sees a swallowed error.**
  opencode's plugin runs .quiet(); a Stop block
  reason goes to the model, not the pane. Each
  run appends one line inside .git: never
  committed. PROVEO_GIT_SYNC_TRACE path | off.
end note

note as N_SCOPE
  **Rows: claudecode, codex, cursor, opencode.**
  cecli wires no turn-end hook, so it has no
  row. cursor has no local model; it skips
  without a funded CURSOR_API_KEY.
end note
@enduml
